{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cubes have lost their minds and become a force of chaos. Can you restore their consciousness? Build your towers, strategize, and defend the light of free thought!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cubes march in a single file, moving as one. This is the beginning of chaos... Stripped of their thoughts, the cubes have become a looming threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/add6c25f8294edcc32d6c115164c67be.poster.avif?t=1770538837\" width=626 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/add6c25f8294edcc32d6c115164c67be.webm?t=1770538837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/add6c25f8294edcc32d6c115164c67be.mp4?t=1770538837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your towers wisely and fortify your defense against waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/c7d17fc4f6678f0e13050ec209349d2c.poster.avif?t=1770538837\" width=680 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/c7d17fc4f6678f0e13050ec209349d2c.webm?t=1770538837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/c7d17fc4f6678f0e13050ec209349d2c.mp4?t=1770538837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Upgrade towers, manage resources, and devise a plan to ensure the triumph of free thought.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/25b94822d12dbc8a5fe75c50eb69c33f.poster.avif?t=1770538837\" width=666 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/25b94822d12dbc8a5fe75c50eb69c33f.webm?t=1770538837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/extras/25b94822d12dbc8a5fe75c50eb69c33f.mp4?t=1770538837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Unique Tower Types:</strong> Each tower has 2 distinct upgrade paths, and each path comes with 2 unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Special Upgrades:</strong> Deep customization options to refine your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-Level Adventure:</strong> Full version includes 20 levels; 5 levels are available in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Epic Boss Fights:</strong> Prepare for challenging battles; the demo features 1 boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter Eggs and Humor:</strong> Discover hidden surprises and laugh along the way.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453110?t=1770538837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770538837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/b69743c6103e097ca992db84a79162806156b298/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770538837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453110/b69743c6103e097ca992db84a79162806156b298/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770538837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_de